      Material="/Script/Engine.Material'm_SimpleVolumetricCloud'"
      Desc="This set of parameters controls the effect of lightning on the clouds.  Source Power controls the intensity of the core of the lighting strike.  Fill Scatter controls the distance the lightning scatters in the clouds.  Fill Scatter intensity controls the brightness of the scattered light.  Lastly the SecondMipLevel controls the sharpness of the details contributed by the second lighting texture sample (where higher values are sharper)."
