      Material="/Script/Engine.Material'm_SimpleVolumetricCloud'"
      Desc="This set of parameters is used to control how the lighting texture is masked in the material.  The lightning mask bias determines at what positions in the CloudLayout texture alpha channel lightning can appear.  The lightning mask strength is multiplied against the biased resut to compensate for lightning masks which are either too opaque or transparent.  The low altitude texture weight determines the influence of the noise texture result on the lighting mask, where higher values increase influence of the texture."
      bCommentBubbleVisible=True
      Outputs(0)=(OutputName="")
      Outputs(1)=(OutputName="LightningMaskBias")
