      Desc="This set of parameters controls the multiscattering approximations in the cloud material.  Intensity controls the overall stregth of the effect, occlusion determines how strongly light is attenuated, and eccentricity determines how uniform the scttering is.  Each of these parameters are valid in the [0, 1] range. "
